WEBVTT

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:11.266
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.516 --> 00:00:16.513
Type "Naira" in the Search box.

00:00:16.763 --> 00:00:21.625
Click Edit Counting Money in Naira.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:25.734
Click Choose poster.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:30.245
Click 0:34 Use this.

00:00:30.495 --> 00:00:35.887
Scroll to Crop and focus.

00:00:36.138 --> 00:00:42.138
Type "Naira notes and coins." in the
Poster description (alt text) box.

00:00:44.063 --> 00:00:47.915
Click Save poster.

00:00:48.165 --> 00:00:54.165
Wait until you see Before you publish.
